# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cloned upstream repositories are NOT pushed.
# They are third-party code, and every one is reproducible: each program's
# SCOPE.md records the clone URL, the checked-out ref and the HEAD commit.
#
# This ignores everything one level inside a program folder, then re-includes
# only the files this collection produced.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*/*

# ...but keep the collection output:
!*/SCOPE.md
!*/program-data.json
!*/program-hackenproof.json

# ...and the explorer-verified contract source we fetched (~130 MB):
!*/deployed-source/
